              "measure": "Outcome Measure: Muscle Strength of the Injured Leg",
              "description": "Outcome Measure: Muscle Strength of the Injured Leg Description: Improvement in muscle strength of the injured leg, specifically targeting hamstrings and quadriceps.\n\nMethod of Measurement: Measured using an isokinetic dynamometer at 60°/second angular velocity.\n\nUnit of Measure: Peak torque (Newton-meters, Nm).",
              "timeFrame": "22 weeks"
